      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can you provide more concrete examples of this? For example, If you open the large UI menu it will be possible to see the hip tracker's position while you move. Comparison between legacy and beta with the tracker position visible would be useful.\nIf this is a rotational issue, then putting your controllers on your actual hip during motion may help communicate the issue.",
